"entity": {
"name": "Virbac SA",
"description": "Virbac SA engages in the manufacture and sale of veterinary medicines. It operates through the following business segments: Companion Animals and Farm Animals. It develops vaccines, antibiotics, anesthetics, dermatological products, and drugs for pest control, inflammation, dental care, and ophthalmological conditions of pets and livestock. It also operates through the following geographical segments: France, Europe, Latin America, North America, Asia, Pacific, and Africa and Middle-East. The Europe segment excludes France. The company was founded by Pierre-Richard Dick and Max Rombi in 1968 and is headquartered in Carros, France.",
